REM Flipper Zero - Windows DiskPart Setup
REM Opens Command Prompt and launches DiskPart

DELAY 1500

REM Open Windows Run
GUI r
DELAY 800

REM Request elevated Command Prompt
STRING powershell -NoProfile -Command "Start-Process cmd -Verb RunAs"
ENTER
DELAY 2000

REM Approve the Windows UAC prompt manually
DELAY 5000

REM Start DiskPart
STRING diskpart
ENTER
DELAY 1500

REM Display connected disks
STRING list disk
ENTER
DELAY 1000

REM Select disk 1
STRING select disk 1
ENTER
DELAY 800

REM Display details for verification
STRING detail disk
ENTER

REM STOP: Verify the disk before proceeding.
REM No erase commands execute automatically.
